  "details": "I’m not sure if this is a bug or a feature, but I’ll put it under feature requests for it to be added back.\nWhen you open the menu, for some reason if you have an action wheel, it gets closed upon opening the menu, this makes it hard for those with drift to even open the menu as we use one handed movement to stay in place, so we can even access the menu without it disappearing upon moving. But before the update, this never happened, and it was easy to traverse the menu with the action wheel not being affected, could this get reversed? Drift is a very common thing, so it’d be great to have a counter to it once again.",
